{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今日もブログ始まるよ！...ドキドキ ...ドキドキ ...ドキドキ」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！77回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\n13日の牛くんさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人PV    予告編"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が公開されましたね！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お芝居をさせて頂いたのですが\nじょしらくを経験してから\nお芝居が楽しくて\n個人PVの撮影時も\nいくつかのパターンを\n同じセリフで試してみたり\nいろいろ挑戦できました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CDが発売されたら\n全編みてねー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もちろん！予告編もみてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/09/3530643/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子ヘアーしてるんだけど\n自分の指がはいっちゃって\n見えなかった写真。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/09/3530643/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/09/3530643/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/09/3530643/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  たいそんさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎なーにー！ここだよー！ここにいるよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  棚からよもぎ餅さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎最近ノギビンゴ5の未公開とかちょっとずつ見てるんだけど、ちょいちょいきいちゃん出てくるからそっちばっか見てしまう笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎私もメイキングムービーみるのすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うそー！！！結構いたずらしてるところかなー？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイキングムービーはメンバーの新しい一面とか見えるから面白いよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  たくまろさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎山形のアンダーライブ参加します！！\nめちゃくちゃ楽しみです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎わー！それはとてもうれしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きて良かった！って思ってもらえるような\n最高なパフォーマンスができるように\nがんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"br